WEBVTT

00:02:28.035 --> 00:02:30.134
And we've been on a journey.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.179
And the debate has raged, hasn't it,

00:02:33.203 --> 00:02:34.559
since the Greeks,

00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:36.700
of isn't it what it's all about?

00:02:37.446 --> 00:02:41.307
Isn't life about the journey,
not really the destination?

00:02:42.415 --> 00:02:44.130
And here we've been on this journey,

00:02:44.154 --> 00:02:46.402
and the truth is, it's been thrilling.

00:02:46.426 --> 00:02:48.173
We haven't reached that other shore,

00:02:48.197 --> 00:02:51.925
and still, our sense
of pride and commitment,

00:02:51.949 --> 00:02:54.088
unwavering commitment.

00:02:54.112 --> 00:02:58.097
When I turned 60,
the dream was still alive

00:02:58.566 --> 00:03:03.165
from having tried this in my 20s --
dreamed it and imagined it.